# Install xCAT Provisioner

{% include "provisioner/provisioner.md.j2" %}

This guide provisions compute nodes in **stateless** (*netboot*) mode: each node
boots a RAM-resident image assembled in a chroot on the head node. Nothing is
written to local disk, and the image is rebuilt and redeployed to change the
nodes. The compute nodes do not boot until the *Deploy Cluster* chapter.

